{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employee 925</strong> is a short existential horror game about work, meritocracy, and performance evaluation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, you arrive at your desk.<br>Every day, you do the job.<br>Every day, you go <strong>\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588</strong>.<br>And then\u2026 you come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a cycle \u2014 a workday with no clear end.<br>Your tasks are vague, your workplace endless, and your role unquestionable.<br>Your name: forgotten.<br>Your identity: disposable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A loop without exit</strong> \u2014 The day always starts the same, and plays out the same. Please comply.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun mandatory training</strong> \u2014 Let us improve together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morse as language</strong> \u2014 Words are dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unsettling familiarity</strong> \u2014 A world in shades of purple and green, where routine is the true horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clock in. Work. Clock out. Repeat. Comply. Comply. Comply.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948890?t=1756393805","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948890/7150d9a9ddf17292345826e8ea803781441c312f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756393805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948890/075940965df08466a5f0034568868ec0ba4710fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756393805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948890/075940965df08466a5f0034568868ec0ba4710fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756393805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achieveme